+// HST Office: the transitions gallery of the Slides ribbon (tab "Chuyển tiếp"), as Office's: one row
+// of transition thumbnails; a click (or Enter) applies the transition to the selected slides with
+// .uno:HstApplyTransition (one undo action, HstTransitionApply.cxx); the transition of the selected
+// slides is shown selected; ◂ ▸ page through the row and ▾ opens the Slide Transition deck with every
+// variant and option. The toolbox item of .uno:HstApplyTransition gets this control
+// (Controller.xcu). Rollback switch: org.openoffice.Office.HSTRibbon/SlidesEffectGalleries hides the
+// item.
